    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> points on a circle. The number of distinct triangles formed by points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is :",
